      "instance_name": "police_officer",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "A male police officer in uniform, wearing a badge, name tag (reading 'BRADLEY'), and a police cap. He is depicted mid-action, with his mouth open as if shouting, one hand pointing forward, and the other holding a white disposable cup from which coffee is spilling. His expression and posture convey dramatic surprise or alarm.",
