      "description": "A police officer is dramatically spilling coffee from a white disposable cup while shouting and pointing forward, with the text 'officer down' overlaid. The scene captures a moment of exaggerated surprise or alarm, using the phrase 'officer down' ironically to describe a mundane mishap.",
