      "label": "Police uniform as a symbol of authority",
      "description": "The police uniform signifies authority and official duty. The juxtaposition of this symbol with a trivial mishap (coffee spill) is central to the meme's humor and requires understanding of societal perceptions of law enforcement and their public image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_548d8bad"
