      "instance_name": "irony_in_meme",
      "label": "Use of situational irony",
      "description": "The meme relies on situational irony — the contrast between the serious phrase 'officer down' and the trivial, comical situation (spilling coffee). This requires background knowledge of rhetorical devices and humor techniques used in internet memes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_548d8bad"
      },
