      "instance_name": "dramatic_alarm",
      "label": "dramatic alarm expression",
      "description": "The police officer's facial expression, with his mouth wide open as if shouting and his eyes wide, conveys a sense of exaggerated alarm or surprise. This is combined with his pointing gesture and the visible coffee spill, creating a theatrical and over-the-top reaction to a mundane event.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
